  "releaseNotes": "AIChatJobStore.Start accepts the client transcript (AIChatSendRequest.Transcript) and passes it to the agent as AIChatAgentRequest.Transcript. RawDataAccessAgent seeds its conversation history from it only when no history exists for the conversation (expired, restarted or another instance), so a chat restored in the browser keeps its context; tool results are not part of the transcript. Requires Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras 0.11.0.",
